# GitHub Linguist Language Overrides
docs/** linguist-documentation
site/** linguist-documentation
tests/** linguist-detectable=false
*.md linguist-documentation
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.svg binary

# Enforce Unix LF line endings for CI workflows and shell scripts
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
.github/workflows/* text eol=lf
